#: StructureDefinition.element.Extension.extension:rekrutierungsziel/short
msgid "Angestrebte Anzahl Teilnehmender"
msgstr "Target number of participants"

# Explanatory notes and implementation guidance about the data element, including notes about how to use the data properly, exceptions to proper use, etc. (Note: The text you are reading is specified in ElementDefinition.comment).
#: StructureDefinition.element.Extension.extension:rekrutierungsziel/comment
msgid "Entspricht ResearchStudy.recruitment.targetNumber in FHIR R5."
msgstr "Corresponds to ResearchStudy.recruitment.targetNumber in FHIR R5."

